cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this Zenodo record and the associated paper when using these files."
type: software
title: "Code and data for Phenotypic assortment and the evolution of cooperation in finite periodic phenotype spaces"
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Kroumi
    given-names: Dhaker
abstract: >-
  Python code, a Jupyter notebook, numerical data, and seven figures for
  a study of phenotype-dependent cooperation on finite periodic phenotype
  spaces. The calculations evaluate the large-population weak-selection
  threshold using finite spectral expressions.
keywords:
  - evolutionary game theory
  - cooperation
  - phenotypic assortment
  - Moran process
  - finite periodic phenotype space
  - weak selection
